{
  "source": "Prompts/Understand-opener-1.mp4",
  "duration": 119.6524375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.56,
      "text": "Sometimes, working with AI feels like having a PhD expert right at your side."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.24,
      "end": 8.3,
      "text": "Other times, it makes a mistake you'd expect from a six-year-old."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.12,
      "end": 11.36,
      "text": "How can the exact same tool do both?"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.16,
      "end": 15.32,
      "text": "To figure that out, we have to clear up what AI actually is."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.96,
      "end": 16.88,
      "text": "It isn't magic."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.26,
      "end": 18.1,
      "text": "It isn't a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.6,
      "end": 20.34,
      "text": "And it is not ordinary software."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.08,
      "end": 25.5,
      "text": "Because it defies those standard categories, the only way to explain its unpredictable"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.5,
      "end": 28.08,
      "text": "behavior is to look at what's happening on the inside."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.78,
      "end": 29.84,
      "text": "Think about driving a car."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.72,
      "end": 33.68,
      "text": "You can get pretty good at it just by using the steering wheel and the pedals,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.9,
      "end": 35.22,
      "text": "without ever opening the hood."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.78,
      "end": 40.6,
      "text": "But if the car starts making a weird noise or suddenly stops working altogether,"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.12,
      "end": 44.4,
      "text": "steering at the dashboard isn't going to help you figure out what went wrong."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.14,
      "end": 49.08,
      "text": "Knowing what's happening underneath that hood is how you actually understand what"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.08,
      "end": 51.76,
      "text": "the vehicle can do and why something might fail."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.5,
      "end": 53.68,
      "text": "The same rule applies to AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.28,
      "end": 57.1,
      "text": "We are going to lift the hood on this specific machine."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.2,
      "end": 59.9,
      "text": "You don't have to become an engineer, but"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.9,
      "end": 63.9,
      "text": "knowing how it works is the fundamental requirement to being smarter than the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.7,
      "end": 66.14,
      "text": "It's time to take a look inside the machine."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.08,
      "end": 68.76,
      "text": "Some of this will be new to you, but"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.76,
      "end": 72.02,
      "text": "the internal architecture is built from individual pieces of logic."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.64,
      "end": 74.38,
      "text": "We are going to take it one piece at a time,"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.78,
      "end": 77.36,
      "text": "letting each piece build clearly on the one before it."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.82,
      "end": 80.64,
      "text": "You do not need to memorize every technical term we come across."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.02,
      "end": 85.24,
      "text": "Our singular objective here is to trace the mechanical path of your input."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.84,
      "end": 89.86,
      "text": "The goal is to understand exactly how your words are translated, processed,"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.28,
      "end": 93.08,
      "text": "and ultimately reformed into a generated answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.06,
      "end": 98.22,
      "text": "This visual map lays out three foundational questions this section will help you"
    },
    {
      "start": 98.22,
      "end": 98.66,
      "text": "answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.4,
      "end": 101.8,
      "text": "Number one, where does AI get all that knowledge?"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.62,
      "end": 106.0,
      "text": "Number two, how does AI seem to understand what I ask?"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.6,
      "end": 109.6,
      "text": "And number three, how does AI come up with its answers?"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.14,
      "end": 114.12,
      "text": "Once you master those mechanics, the machine won't feel like magic anymore."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.8,
      "end": 116.18,
      "text": "Let's take it a piece at a time."
    }
  ],
